+requirement for that layout type.  This need not be a protocol as
+normally understood.  In some cases, the same protocol may be used
+as both a control protocol and storage protocol.</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-2-1.5">storage protocol:</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-2-1.6">the protocol used by clients to do I/O operations
+to the storage device.  Each layout type specifies the set of
+storage protocols.</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-2-1.7">loose coupling:</dt>
