+servers.  See <xref target="section-2.1" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 2.1"/> for further discussion.</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-2-1.17">fencing:</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-2-1.18">the process by which the metadata server prevents the
+storage devices from processing I/O from a specific client to a
+specific file.</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-2-1.19">layout:</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-2-1.20">
+          <t indent="0" pn="section-2-1.20.1">the information a client uses to access file data on a
