+<xref target="RFC5661" section="12.5.2" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedLink="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5661#section-12.5.2" derivedContent="RFC5661"/>).  Further, <xref target="RFC5661" section="12.5.3" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedLink="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5661#section-12.5.3" derivedContent="RFC5661"/> describes differences in handling between layout
